    "text": "\"Hey.\" A man, maybe 50s, with weathered hands settles near you, not too close. \"Day one. Everyone's pretending they're fine. ...Can we talk? Just talk — like people used to.\" (Talk to A man, maybe 50s, with weathered hands.)"
